<urn:atm:triage:resolution/BB6-002/1>
  a triage:Resolution ;
  triage:resolutionNote "BB6-QA-STORAGE-FIX-1789267000 (PR #1459 comment, 2026-09-13T00:26:25Z): PASS 0/0/0. quality-mgr independently re-verified directly against the pinned diff (35b733c09 vs a7d4664d1): InMemoryTaskLedgerReader::list_prompt_handoffs now filters and returns real in-memory rows via the relocated consumer-owned test." .

